      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Washington‑on‑the‑Brazos State Historic Site houses the Star of the Republic Museum, a replica of Independence Hall, and Barrington Plantation, home of last Texas Republic President Anson Jones.",
